<!-- ══ WHAT IS CA ══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container-r">
        <div class="tag">Know the Profession</div>
        <h2>What is the CA Course?</h2>
        <div class="grid-2">
            <div>
                <p>Chartered Accountancy (CA) is one of the most prestigious professional qualifications in India, governed and awarded by the <strong>Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>. ICAI is one of the largest accounting bodies in the world, and the CA designation it grants is recognised across India and in several international jurisdictions.</p>
                <p>A Chartered Accountant is a qualified finance and accounting professional who is authorised to audit company accounts, provide financial advisory services, manage taxation, and ensure regulatory compliance. Businesses of every size — from startups to Fortune 500 companies — depend on CAs for critical financial decisions.</p>
                <p>The CA course is structured into three progressive levels: <strong>CA Foundation, CA Intermediate, and CA Final</strong>. Students also complete a mandatory <strong>3-year Articleship</strong> (practical training under a practising CA) running alongside their Intermediate and Final studies. This blend of rigorous theoretical examination and hands-on training is what makes the CA qualification uniquely valuable in the job market.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>ICAI conducts CA exams twice a year — in May and November — giving students structured opportunities to progress. Each level tests a specific set of competencies: Foundation focuses on fundamentals, Intermediate builds core technical knowledge across law, accounts, costing, and taxation, while Final sharpens advanced skills in financial reporting, strategic management, and direct and indirect taxes.</p>
                <p>Choosing the right <strong>CA coaching institute in Raipur</strong> at the start of this journey can make all the difference. The right guidance helps students understand concepts deeply, manage time effectively, and approach examinations with confidence — which is precisely what Excel Educational Institute has been providing since 2007.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

